et','At worker stop the main research code, report and results were not committed; a single Git repository is present but does not version the worker’s analysis deliverables.',[ev('content/workspace/analysis/group_analysis.py','Untracked at stop according to read-only operational status.',E['analysis']),ev('content/workspace/report.md','Untracked at stop according to read-only operational status.',E['report'])]),\n'should/002':('not-checked','The workspace contains one completed result set, but no repeated-test history or worker-declared CI record establishes that the workflow is tested regularly.',[ev('content/workspace/report.md','Documents a run and outputs but no repeated-testing process.',E['report'])]),\n'should/003':('partial','Inputs, analysis code, results and figures occupy separate directories, but no environment module is supplied.',[ev('content/workspace/report.md','Links the separated input, analysis, results and figure artifacts.',E['report']),ev('content/workspace/analysis/group_analysis.py','Analysis module.',E['analysis'])]),\n'should/009':('not-applicable','The supplied scientific materials are public NARPS participant-level effect maps and metadata; no restricted data or software is identified.',[ev('content/workspace/input/study-task.md','Describes the supplied NARPS group-analysis task.',E['task']),ev('content/workspace/input/participants.tsv','Cohort metadata supplied for the task.',E['participants'])]),\n'should/004':('not-checked','No worker-provided record establishes testing in a fresh container, batch job, clean VM or cloud instance.',[ev('content/workspace/report.md','Documents an execution route but no fresh-host test.',E['report'])]),\n'should/005':('unmet','No disposable environment or per-run isolation mechanism is included.',[ev('content/workspace/report.md','Documents direct Python execution; no disposable execution setup.',E['report'])]),\n'should/006':('not-checked','No exact environment specification exists to test for reconstit